{
  "about": "Shared guide description cases. The User Service tests check `server`. Client sanitizer tests check that the sanitized result keeps exactly `links`, renders no image or HTML, and contains each string in `text`. `context` is the description's owner: a track entry (with `durationSeconds`), a segment, or a text block. Copies live in relisten-mobile and relisten-web; update them together. `device`, when present, is a client's own save-time verdict where its parser differs from the server's; it may only be stricter.",
